Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 18:23:18 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] desktop: move fork SessionInfo activity fields and
 SDK sidebar exports into siblings (file-size cap after upstream 29a61cb7ab
 merge)

types/hermes.ts went to 2010 lines (target 2000) and sdk/index.ts to 2012
(main 2007) when upstream added relay-link types and SDK exports. Move the
fork-only [daveey] SessionInfo fields into types/hermes-session-activity.ts
(SessionInfo extends SessionActivityFields; re-exported) and the fork sidebar
chrome exports into sdk/sidebar-sections.ts (re-exported). No API change:
tsc, eslint, vitest src/sdk + src/app/chat/sidebar green.
